e only just beginning to unfold."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138683"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7ad484ce4966215a8d831d80a3ad1c5c26e063093110344ee400ecec52603202.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/754e854bc8e2b81ab76a1ed6c43b9c3d0a0ccd98583e9f7314225d04322f7de6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"樹 冬華","creatorId":"vndb:s40237","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s40237","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s40237","name":"樹 冬華","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98137","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138684","characterName":"安江","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138684"},"originalCharacterName":"安江","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once a renowned grand mage, the calm and cheerful Lady Yasue now finds herself sealed in an unchanging Sapporo; one eternally stuck in the Meiji era."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Only a century later would she find company beyond those she was sealed with, when the confused and afraid Honoka inadvertently visited her sealed world. Even locked away from reality, Lady Yasue continues to direct magical performances at her beloved kabuki venue, and is only too happy to dote on her new visitor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138684"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78c716870e92d74f63ac24a4e83ce65970a046c3ed327048d0758f1229354624.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/811c3de73ab7f0269d9e79c68348ae163b5c7f18526e53fd5de7a709ec2a10b8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ふじた まみ","creatorId":"vndb:s7951","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7951","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7951","name":"ふじた まみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98135","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138685","characterName":"菊池 志乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138685"},"originalCharacterName":"菊池 志乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"When the previous university librarian retired, their replacement couldn't have been more different. Athletic, upbeat, and outgoing to a fault, Shino Kikuchi seizes every opportunity to chat with the soft-spoken student who stays long after the library's normal closing hours."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From an unusual delight in new technology to her odd attitude towards her work, Shino presents a puzzling figure to a bemused Honoka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138685"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91d646464244c0f61f1b1f46cd9fbb24ee0f0bfb7a50209d8270cf2860762313.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5a7f644a20bf24995428e8563c39f7a666268204a4c3e47ddf48df2224895e9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉田 春花","creatorId":"vndb:s20490","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20490","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20490","name":"杉田春花","rol